      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "set up env to use statsforecast\n",
        "naive forecast modelis a very simple forecasting method where the prediction for the next period is simply the last observed value.\n",
        "\n",
        " WindowAverage time series forecasting technique. It predicts future values by calculating the average of a fixed number of past observations, known as the 'window'.\n",
        "\n",
        " SeasonalNaive predicts future values by taking the value from the same season in the previous period.\n",
        "\n",
        " Historic - predicts future values by calculating the mean (average) of the entire historical series for each unique_id. Essentially, it assumes that the future value will be the average of all past observed values for that specific series"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "Bl0YbUiAGtou"
      }
    },
